{
    "Description": {
        "Id": "starsystemdef_Westerwind",
        "Name": "Westerwind",
        "Details": "Westerwind is something of a rocky planet that is rather dry, although near it's polar region it has plenty of frozen ice and snow.  It is actually a moon of a gas giant.  Having a moderate population of wealthy merchants and workers, it is famous for it's extensive stores and marketplaces, with much to offer those with money.  Like other star systems in the area, it is under the control and ownership of The Federateed Suns, unless you ask a local group of terrorists that illegally call themselves a local \"government\" with no authority to do so as they attempt a civil war and try to overthrow House Davion's control of the star system, with much futility.  Regardless, they are an annoyance, and The Federated Suns work with the MRB in this area to stomp out the rebellion.  Aside from that, Westerwind is a good place for shopping, and is also a well-known spot for finding and hiring battlemech pilots who are some of the best.  When spending time here, Westerwind offers a good amount of work for any mercenary group of mechwarriors who are willing to fight rebels for some decent cash.  Oh, and this place is one of few that offers reconditioned SLDF technology for sale in it's marketplaces, at least once in a while.",
        "Icon": ""
    },
